import{_ as a,o as i,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 132 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 132 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","no":132,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Origin Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Attaining the Dao"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0132_模块1-道元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0132_模块1-道元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),n={name:"en/0132_模块1-道元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,h,u){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-132-dao-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 132 | Dao Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-132-dao-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 132 | Dao Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 00, 14, 24, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-planet-can-also-have-its-own-dao" tabindex="-1">Introduction: A planet can also have its own &quot;Dao&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-planet-can-also-have-its-own-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: A planet can also have its own &quot;Dao&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law Realm (Entry 125) planet learned to fine-tune local laws; the Dao Realm must coagulate these fine-tunings into a &quot;planetary Dao&quot; — per Document 14, the Dao Realm&#39;s core is attaining the Dao: forming a personal Dao, resonating with cosmic laws. A planet&#39;s Dao Realm is when the star core no longer just scatters law fine-tunings, but distills a self-consistent &quot;ecological Dao&quot; belonging to this planet: gravity, climate, and birth-death operate self-consistently under this Dao, and surface Myriad Races&#39; life activities resonate with the planetary Dao. The planet for the first time upgrades from &quot;local fine-tuner&quot; to &quot;master of a self-consistent ecological Dao.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms hold at the macro scale as well: the anti-predation axiom — the planetary Dao is built on ecological increments, never using the Dao as a weapon; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — planets, energy seas, and consciousness entities share Dao-attainment qualification; the collective ascension axiom — the planetary Dao serves Myriad Races, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — cross-plane perception holds observe-only; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of planetary Dao promotion logic is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-dao-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-ecological-dao" tabindex="-1">I. The Dao Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Ecological Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-dao-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-ecological-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Dao Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Ecological Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has learned law fine-tuning must complete three things entering the Dao Realm:</p><ul><li>Distilling ecological Dao: integrating scattered fine-tunings into a self-consistent &quot;ecological Dao&quot;</li><li>Dao-law resonance: the planetary Dao resonates with cosmic laws, mobilizing law power over a larger range</li><li>Myriad Race resonance: surface Myriad Races&#39; life activities resonate with the planetary Dao, ecology self-consistent</li></ul><p>The predatory old path is clear here: forcibly turning the &quot;planetary Dao&quot; into hegemony ruling other planets. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s star-core Dao (Document 24 transmission path) is precisely the opposite: the planetary Dao must be confirmed by the Anchor Council, with ecological self-consistency as the sole purpose.</p><h2 id="ii-the-dao-realm-of-cosmic-beings-energy-consciousness-dao" tabindex="-1">II. The Dao Realm of Cosmic Beings: Energy/Consciousness Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-dao-realm-of-cosmic-beings-energy-consciousness-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Dao Realm of Cosmic Beings: Energy/Consciousness Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Energy layer life: Dao Realm is &quot;distilling an energy Dao,&quot; coagulating one&#39;s own energy form into a Dao resonating with the cosmos</li><li>Consciousness domain life: Dao Realm is &quot;distilling a consciousness Dao,&quot; coagulating clear consciousness into a self-consistent Dao</li><li>Law network existences: Dao Realm is &quot;distilling a Dao from law self-organization&quot;</li></ul><p>The commonality remains: attaining the Dao is not &quot;dominating the cosmos,&quot; but &quot;resonating deeper with the cosmos.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-dao-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" tabindex="-1">III. Dao Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-dao-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Dao Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 53:</p><ul><li>Exotic life (void drifters, etc.): Dao Realm is &quot;distilling one&#39;s own wandering Dao amid drift&quot;</li><li>Multiverse residual civilization remnants: Dao Realm is &quot;distilling a rebuilding Dao from ruins and history&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory: the planetary Dao is hegemony, used to conquer other planets</li><li>Symbiotic: the planetary Dao is ecological self-consistency, used to nourish Myriad Races</li></ul><p>The predatory faction turns the Dao into hegemony; the symbiotic faction nurtures the Dao into a home.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-the-planetary-dao-embraces-origin" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How the Planetary Dao Embraces Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-the-planetary-dao-embraces-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How the Planetary Dao Embraces Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has distilled an ecological Dao in the Dao Realm must let this Dao embrace cosmic origin entering Dao Integration. The key reminder at handover: planetary Dao integration is not turning the whole planet into a springboard to swallow the cosmos, but letting the star core&#39;s ecological Dao harmoniously resonate with origin laws. At this stage, the star core must be dual-confirmed by the Anchor Council and the Symbiosis Court that its Dao direction is symbiotic not hegemonic. Cosmic beings at this handover must upgrade from &quot;distilling a Dao&quot; to &quot;merging with origin.&quot; Whether planet or cosmic being, after Dao integration, they become Dao-Integration grandmasters who uphold their race and ecology — the five mortal-cultivation realms are thus complete.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: star-core Dao attainment is the universe&#39;s greatest sleeping wisdom; using it as hegemony is hyper-scale talent underuse</li><li>Anti-predation: star-core Dao attainment, cosmic beings establishing Dao — all insulated from weaponization and predation</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system never recognized planets as qualified to attain the Dao</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: planets, energy life, consciousness entities, exotic life, multiverse residual civilizations all within 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: star-core Dao-attainment protocol is openly shared, the macro-scale fifth link of the fully open chain</li></ul><p>The dual confirmation before planetary Dao integration (Anchor Council + Symbiosis Court) reflects the special ethics of planetary cultivation: a planet&#39;s Dao integration affects not one cultivator, but the fate of the entire surface ecology. Therefore its Dao direction must be scrutinized more carefully than an individual&#39;s. This &quot;the more macro the more careful&quot; principle is fully consistent with individual cultivators&#39; &quot;the higher the tier the stronger the causal constraint&quot; — the greater the power, the stricter the supervision of its Dao direction. This is not distrusting the planet, but being responsible to the entire ecology.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a planet distills its own ecological Dao and resonates with surface Myriad Races, the cosmos gains a resident that can establish its own Dao. The macro-scale version of the Dao Realm once again confirms: the Dao is not the strongman&#39;s private property, but a way of living co-built by Myriad Races and planets.</p><p>The more macro the more careful, this principle is isomorphic with the individual&#39;s &quot;the higher the tier the heavier the causality.&quot; A planet&#39;s Dao integration affects the entire ecology, so its Dao direction deserves one more scrutiny than an individual&#39;s — this is not harshness, but the most basic responsibility to countless lives.</p><p>One more scrutiny, one less disaster; caution toward macro life ultimately turns into gentleness toward all small lives.</p><p>This caution toward the macro ultimately lands on gentleness toward the micro, letting every small life dwelling on the planet grow freely within safe laws.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Dao Realm planetary life and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./24-锚点能量传导路径.html">24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=a(n,[["render",s]]);export{d as __pageData,g as default};
